v class="CompareBtn_CompareBtnWrapper__TP1TT"><div class="ToolTip_tooltipWrapper__x8HLD"><div class="IconButton_IconButton__M3Ou9 undefined PropertyCardPLP_CompareBtn__bcA_H CompareBtn_CompareBtn__PnSOK undefined" style="width:48px;height:36px;border-radius:100px" data-testid="icon-button" aria-disabled="false"><img alt="compare-inactive-primary" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" as="image" fetchpriority="high" loading="eager" width="20" height="20" data-nimg="1" class="CompareBtn_icon__pV71H" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/compare-inactive-primary.svg"/></div></div></div></div></div><div class="PropertyCardPLP_ConfigTextCtn__b7qiG"><div class="undefined PropertyCardPLP_ConfigText__r8cpc text_text-13px__hG9vV" data-testid="text-custom">3.5 BHK</div></div><div class="PropertyCardPLP_PossessionCarpetOuterCtn__Hg2xk"><div class="PropertyCardPLP_PossessionCarpetInner__Sp_N5"><div class="PropertyCardPLP_PropertyDataSecondaryCtn__gjeoC"><div class="undefined PropertyCardPLP_DetailHeading__xSNRM text_text-13px__hG9vV" data-testid="text-custom">Possession</div><div class="undefined PropertyCardPLP_FloorConfigText__s_Iay text_text-13px__hG9vV" data-testid="text-custom">01 Jul 2026</div></div><div class="PropertyCardPLP_PropertyDataSecondaryCtn__gjeoC"><div class="undefined PropertyCardPLP_DetailHeading__xSNRM text_text-13px__hG9vV" data-testid="text-custom">Carpet Area</div><div class="undefined PropertyCardPLP_FloorConfigText__s_Iay text_text-13px__hG9vV" data-testid="text-custom">1725 sq. ft.</div></div></div></div></div><div class="PropertyCardPLP_CardActionCtn__rLF9U"><div class="TruncateTextPopup_TruncateWrapper__bkl0H" style="max-width:100%"><div class="TruncateTextPopup_TruncateTextCtn__YKvv7  "><p class="TruncateTextPopup_TruncateText__LsZmN ">Presenting H M Central Park, a captivating project that exemplifies well-planned living spaces crafted with utmost thoughtfulness, all offered at affordable prices. Nestled in the coveted area of Tardeo, H M Central Park invites you to embrace a lifestyle fit for royalty. Your home becomes an idyllic retreat, whisking you away from the demands of the bustling city, as H M Central Park creates an ambience that makes you forget you&#x27;re in the heart of it all. These 3.5 BHK residential apartments in Tardeo present luxurious abodes that effortlessly shield you from the clamour of the city centre. Additionally, residing in such a desirable locality offers a multitude of benefits. Immerse yourself in the advantages of living in apartments with excellent surroundings, making H M Central Park the epitome of refined living.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="SearchPage_SearchPageCtnNext__k1NmT"><div class="SeoLinks_mainbg__ZcXcY "><div class="SeoLinks_SeoFooterlinks__kFzjA "><h2 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm SeoLinks_SeoMainHeading__QyLss"><div class="undefined  text_desktop-heading-1__CG19e" data-testid="text-custom">Properties for sale in Mumbai</div></h2><div></div><div class="SeoLinks_SeoColumns__Je_yx "><div class="SeoLinks_SeoColumn__2iU0q"><h2 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm SeoLinks_ColumnHeader__H3649"><div class="undefined  text_desktop-heading-5__YAUk5" data-testid="text-custom">Developers in Mumbai</div></h2><ul class="SeoLinks_collapsedList__Pba4y"><li><a class="seointerlink " href="/buy/mumbai/vikas-constructions-1a256b13a1397">Vikas Constructions Projects in Mumbai</a></li><li><a class="seointerlink " href="/buy/mumbai/rupji-constructions-1a256b13a2802">Rupji Constructions Projects in Mumbai</a></li><li><a class="seointerlink " href="/buy/mumbai/pinal-realty-1a256b13a4416">Pinal Realty Projects in Mumbai</a></li><li><a class="seointerlink " href="/buy/mumbai/n-rose-developers-1a256b13a468">N Rose Developers Projects in Mumbai</a></li><li><a class="seointerlink " href="/buy/mumbai/mehta-group-1a256b13a411">Mehta Group Projects in Mumbai</a></li><li><a class="seointerlink " href="/buy/mumbai/supreme-realtors-1a256b13a15